        <title>notes:8glasses</title>
        <link>https://shared2-smtp3.our-ns.com/w/notes/8glasses?rev=1242900317&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>The Myth of 8-10 Glasses of Water per Day

There is a persistent recommendation on the net that people should drink 8-10 glasses of water per day; and that that water should be in the form of water and not any other kind of beverage.  This is an overestimate and misinterpretation.  The</description>
